279
00:20:04,720 --> 00:20:06,477
He's going to make a big wave.

280
00:20:06,560 --> 00:20:07,680
Okay, I get it.

281
00:20:07,840 --> 00:20:09,837
You really love this brother of yours.

282
00:20:09,920 --> 00:20:10,750
Yeah, so what?

283
00:20:10,900 --> 00:20:11,857
