And as for this statue, the truth is
I'm the one who attacked it first.

288
00:20:26,560 --> 00:20:27,820
But then Ace said,

289
00:20:28,400 --> 00:20:30,857
Tell Kaido that this is a warning from me.

290
00:20:30,940 --> 00:20:34,357
I'll be back someday to give his
real face the same treatment.

291
00:20:34,440 --> 00:20:35,270
I see.

292
00:20:35,353 --> 00:20:39,457
I did not know there was a pirate who
tried to save the land of Wano in the past.

293
00:20:39,540 --> 00:20:41,540
My father was angry, of course.

294
00:20:41,940 --> 00:20:44,420
But in the end, he never met Ace.

295
00:20:44,800 --> 00:20:46,060
