Should I explain it again?

305
00:21:05,200 --> 00:21:06,553
Kaido's my enemy, okay?

306
00:21:06,840 --> 00:21:08,977
I dream of sailing on a big adventure!

307
00:21:09,060 --> 00:21:11,178
I'm Odin, who only wants to be free!

308
