Waiting for him to come back to see me.

320
00:21:36,180 --> 00:21:39,768
But me and a loopy couldn't even
break the news to me gently.

321
00:21:41,780 --> 00:21:43,460
Ace is dead now!

322
00:21:44,540 --> 00:21:46,277
He just said it out of the blue.

323
