It broke my heart to a thousand pieces.

324
00:21:49,000 --> 00:21:51,817
Sorry, he can be like that sometimes.

325
00:21:51,900 --> 00:21:53,317
He didn't mean to hurt you.

326
00:21:53,400 --> 00:21:54,860
But you know, Otama?

327
00:21:55,420 --> 00:21:57,917
Yeah, Luffy's been
through a lot of pain too.

328
00:21:58,000 --> 00:21:58,880
It was tough.

329
00:22:01,460 --> 00:22:03,380
Stop screwing up my party!

330
00:22:08,100 --> 00:22:09,400
Yo, losers!

331
00:22:09,780 --> 00:22:11,500
Pluck that turkey's wings!

332
00:22:12,600 --> 00:22:15,240
Don't just stand there, kill that bozo!

333
00:22:17,040 --> 00:22:18,158
Doesn't seem right.

334
00:22:18,280 --> 00:22:21,240
I mean, that guy saved
our lives. Yeah, I know.

335
00:22:21,560 --> 00:22:23,913
But the boss will kill us if we disobey.

336
00:22:24,860 --> 00:22:27,460
Do you want me to smash your heads in?

337
00:22:27,620 --> 00:22:29,660
Now get your asses in there!

338
00:22:34,480 --> 00:22:38,060
To be honest, I wasn't planning
on going after Kaido myself.

339
00:22:39,760 --> 00:22:41,120
Nico Robin, Mr.

340
00:22:41,260 --> 00:22:42,960
Bones, do what you gotta do.

341
00:22:43,400 --> 00:22:44,700
Run to the castle!

342
00:22:45,280 --> 00:22:46,500
That's fine with me.

343
00:22:46,740 --> 00:22:48,505
If you insist, then we're off.

344
00:22:48,760 --> 00:22:50,660
You're gonna suffer, Marco!

345
00:22:58,620 --> 00:23:00,557
Thought you could take all of us, huh?

346
00:23:00,640 --> 00:23:02,640
You walk straight into your grave.

347
00:23:12,840 --> 00:23:14,260
You guys ready?

348
00:23:14,740 --> 00:23:15,860
Let's do this.

349
00:23:34,720 --> 00:23:36,317
Come on now, how is that?

350
00:23:36,400 --> 00:23:38,977
Fair, this is great!

351
00:23:39,060 --> 00:23:42,137
You're about to face off
with an emperor, you know!

352
00:23:42,220 --> 00:23:45,417
You're not nervous at all, of course, not?

353
00:23:45,500 --> 00:23:46,657
What good would that do?

354
00:23:46,740 --> 00:23:50,537
My captain gives the order,
and I follow as simple as that!

355
00:23:50,620 --> 00:23:54,237
I'm counting on Straw Hat to
pull through and not just him!

356
00:23:54,320 --> 00:23:56,640
Everyone from the worst generation.

357
00:23:58,720 --> 00:24:00,837
I wonder what Ace would
have said if he knew his

358
00:24:00,920 --> 00:24:04,155
brother was picking a fight
with an Emperor of the Sea.

359
00:24:04,400 --> 00:24:06,260
I'm begging! Come on!

360
00:24:06,500 --> 00:24:07,620
I said no!

361
00:24:07,940 --> 00:24:08,780
Now drop it!

362
00:24:11,220 --> 00:24:13,800
How many times do we have to go over this?

363
00:24:14,440 --> 00:24:18,760
I told you who the Second Division
Commander was before you, didn't I?

364
00:24:19,160 --> 00:24:22,280
And I told you why the
position was vacant.

365
00:24:23,200 --> 00:24:27,259
Wano's isolationist policy played
a part in that too, we didn't know.

366
00:24:27,520 --> 00:24:28,620
In other words,

367
