since no info got in or out, it was
years before we heard Lord Odin died.

368
00:24:34,660 --> 00:24:38,157
We thought about forcing our way
into Wano and starting a fight,

369
00:24:38,240 --> 00:24:40,917
but there's a hundred different
ways that plan could go south.

370
00:24:41,000 --> 00:24:41,830
Win or lose?

371
00:24:42,500 --> 00:24:44,940
