I have to keep my promise.

387
00:25:45,300 --> 00:25:47,917
That's a heavy weight you
decided to carry, Ace.

388
00:25:48,000 --> 00:25:49,200
I'm just saying.

389
00:25:49,700 --> 00:25:52,300
So if Pops ever lets you go, call me.

390
00:25:52,500 --> 00:25:54,580
I'd be happy to fight by your side.

391
00:25:54,800 --> 00:25:56,271
You can count me in, too.

392
00:25:57,380 --> 00:25:58,210
Oh, yeah?

393
00:25:58,500 --> 00:26:00,100
Then we can win easy.

394
00:26:01,820 --> 00:26:04,560
A little optimism is good, but come on.

395
00:26:18,780 --> 00:26:20,220
Come on, Marco!

396
00:26:20,600 --> 00:26:24,177
