you and dominate the new era!

409
00:27:11,200 --> 00:27:12,030
Ah!

410
00:27:17,380 --> 00:27:18,210
Dammit!

411
00:27:21,520 --> 00:27:26,960
Marco, forget these losers! Let's
go! Get ready! On three! On three!

412
00:27:28,520 --> 00:27:29,540
I wasn't ready!

413
00:27:46,520 --> 00:27:47,500
Wow, Luffy?

414
00:27:47,760 --> 00:27:49,200
It's Ace's brother!

415
00:27:49,880 --> 00:27:50,860
Um, yeah.

416
00:27:51,300 --> 00:27:52,418
I thought you knew.

417
00:27:52,720 --> 00:27:56,840
Like I said, he kind of sounded
cold, but he talked about his death.

418
00:27:57,880 --> 00:27:59,520
But Ace is dead now.

419
00:28:00,300 --> 00:28:02,300
Oh, I was the jerk.

420
00:28:02,560 --> 00:28:04,017
I said all of a things to Luffy.

421
00:28:04,100 --> 00:28:05,660
I wouldn't worry.

422
00:28:05,880 --> 00:28:07,860
That's just Luffy being Luffy.

423
00:28:08,160 --> 00:28:09,140
It'll be okay.

424
00:28:10,640 --> 00:28:12,677
Yeah, but big bro!

425
00:28:12,760 --> 00:28:14,820
I gotta tell him I'm sorry!

426
00:28:15,220 --> 00:28:17,044
I told you not to worry, right?

427
00:28:17,460 --> 00:28:21,600
Well, anyway, we should work on
that plan you came up with, Otama.

428
00:28:21,920 --> 00:28:23,340
I know you got this!

429
00:28:29,680 --> 00:28:35,617
Wait, so Roger had a son, and he's
Luffy's brother—that's quite the friend!

430
00:28:35,700 --> 00:28:36,577
You made, yeah?

431
00:28:36,660 --> 00:28:38,797
Can you believe it?

432
00:28:38,880 --> 00:28:42,917
Without knowing that you brought
Luffy to Wano—indeed, we did!

433
00:28:43,000 --> 00:28:47,877
Pirates are as numerous as stars
in the sky, and yet you met him.

434
00:28:47,960 --> 00:28:50,777
Ace's promise will finally come true.

435
00:28:50,860 --> 00:28:53,317
This can't be anything but destiny! I.

436
00:28:53,400 --> 00:28:54,260
destiny I

437
00:28:56,740 --> 00:28:59,760
Mean the answers in front
of us the will of D.

438
00:28:59,960 --> 00:29:02,400
It's right there in Luffy's name

439
00:29:07,940 --> 00:29:10,200
Ma ma ma ma

440
00:29:23,060 --> 00:29:25,300
Oh, yeah! Tasty!

441
00:29:28,240 --> 00:29:33,180
Nom, nom, nom, no, that's a snack!

442
00:29:37,020 --> 00:29:37,850
Good.

443
00:29:37,933 --> 00:29:41,340
I was so hungry, but now I'm full.

444
00:29:41,860 --> 00:29:44,940
Full of raw power.

445
00:29:45,160 --> 00:29:47,000
You boys enjoy your meal?

446
00:29:47,240 --> 00:29:48,120
Yes, Mama.

447
00:29:48,460 --> 00:29:49,840
I'm good to go.

448
00:29:50,440 --> 00:29:51,270
Huh?

449
00:29:52,240 --> 00:29:54,140
Well, time's a-wasting.

450
00:30:05,780 --> 00:30:08,380
Straw Hats still hasn't shown up?

451
00:30:09,240 --> 00:30:10,593
Here's the deal, Kaido.

452
00:30:11,080 --> 00:30:13,457
Kill as many of the
Straw Hats as you like.

453
00:30:13,540 --> 00:30:16,020
But Miss Nico Robin is coming with me.

454
00:30:16,840 --> 00:30:18,117
