460
00:30:27,800 --> 00:30:28,630
Fine.

461
00:30:28,900 --> 00:30:30,520
Have it your way, then.

462
00:30:34,200 --> 00:30:37,757
Humble though our strength may
be, we have held this staircase.

463
00:30:37,840 --> 00:30:38,840
Proceed this way.

464
00:30:39,120 --> 00:30:41,473
It shall lead Yugara to the castle roof.

465
00:30:42,160 --> 00:30:44,240
Wow, thanks, Lion Viper.

466
00:30:44,420 --> 00:30:45,480
It's Shishikin.

467
00:30:45,740 --> 00:30:47,840
I won't forget how you helped Race.

468
00:30:48,200 --> 00:30:51,847
You guys are really brave, so
promise me you'll hang in there.

469
00:30:52,020 --> 00:30:53,240
Don't you worry.

470
00:30:53,820 --> 00:30:55,240
I'll handle Kaido.

471
00:31:00,420 --> 00:31:03,800
Now, where exactly are you
going to drop this island?

472
00:31:04,140 --> 00:31:05,577
In the middle of the capital.

473
