484
00:31:40,500 --> 00:31:44,277
Even after all this time, you're
still like a little brother to me.

485
00:31:44,360 --> 00:31:46,440
That said, let me remind you.

486
00:31:46,620 --> 00:31:49,577
That day in God's Valley
when rocks came to an end,

487
00:31:49,660 --> 00:31:52,980
it was me who gave you the
mythical fish fish fruit.

488
00:31:54,140 --> 00:31:57,280
That's a debt you'll owe
for the rest of your life.

489
00:31:57,860 --> 00:31:59,200
Say what you like.

490
00:32:05,120 --> 00:32:07,708
We'll settle this after
we get our treasure.

491
00:32:08,340 --> 00:32:10,440
The One Piece that is!
